                        {
                          "kind": "scalar",
                          "tag": "!!str",
                          "value": "parker_prefix",
                          "head": "# Parker VMs are named \u003cparker_prefix\u003e-parker-\u003cvmid\u003e and the CPI pools\n# them in a resource pool called \u003cparker_prefix\u003e-parker. Naming the\n# prefix after the bloc keeps every director in one bloc sharing its own\n# parkers, and keeps two blocs on the same PVE cluster from adopting\n# each other's. `ocfp vault populate` does not write this key, so it is\n# not sourced from vault; the bloc name comes from params.ocfp_bloc,\n# which the env file already sets for the shared blobstore path. The\n# literal \"bosh\" is the CPI's own fallback, so a bloc that names neither\n# keeps the parker names it had before CPI 0.6.0.",
